    "created_at": "2016-08-05T01:17:37Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-05T01:17:37Z",
    "body": "Yeah, that info is basically only for authors, definitely not for UA implementors or parser developers.\n\nAt the beginning of the section that subsection is in, [there’s a note](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/syntax.html#writing):\n\n> This section only applies to documents, authoring tools, and markup generators. In particular, it does not apply to conformance checkers; conformance checkers must use the requirements given in the next section (\"parsing HTML documents\").\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
