    "created_at": "2016-08-05T08:06:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-08-05T08:06:16Z",
    "body": "> @inikulin, do you agree?\n\nAbsolutely. \n\n> This section only applies to documents, **authoring tools**, and markup generators. \n\nThis is exactly what I was looking for: I've needed simple parser for editor auto-formatting feature - just a basic nesting logic on top of tokenizer. To maintain open elements stack I've used this list as a reference. And I find it pretty odd that my editor shows these elements as non-void, while they are actually is.\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
